OL,3,GNEWSAWoman praises care workers after
OL,4,Aclifftop visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has praised those who helped
OL,7,Fher rehabilitation after she visited a
OL,8,Ffavourite beauty spot despite having
OL,9,Fblood cancer and experiencing a
OL,10,Flife-changing stroke.
OL,12,FHazell Wilson, from Margate, was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with cancer in 2021 before
OL,14,Fhaving a stroke which affected her
OL,15,Fspeech, mobility and daily life.
OL,17,FIt left her unable to leave her house,
OL,18,Fbut she had one goal - to get into the
OL,19,Fcar and go to the clifftops that she
OL,20,Floves at Palm Bay.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
