OL,3,GNEWSAWoman praises care workers after
OL,4,Aclifftop visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhysiotherapist Harry Hopkins, from
OL,7,FKent Community Health Foundation Trust,
OL,8,Fsaid: "From the first assessment, it
OL,9,Fwas clear how important it was for
OL,10,FHazell to regain as much independence
OL,11,Fas possible at home."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
